description:
Implement `useFormSchema` — a hook that manages form values and runs per-field validation based on a schema. Each schema entry is a validator function returning an error string or `null` for valid.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { values, errors, handleChange, validate, isValid } = useFormSchema(
  {
    email: (v) => String(v).includes('@') ? null : 'Invalid email',
    age: (v) => Number(v) >= 18 ? null : 'Must be 18+',
  },
  { email: '', age: '' }
);

handleChange('email', 'alice@example.com');
validate(); // runs all validators
console.log(isValid); // true if all pass
```

